{'symbol': 'TMO', 'date': '2022-10-24 08:30:00', 'title': 'THERMO FISHER SCIENTIFIC DEMONSTRATES COMMITMENT TO TRANSPLANT PATIENTS AND COLLABORATION AT ASHI 2022', 'text': 'LAS VEGAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THERMO FISHER SCIENTIFIC, THE WORLD LEADER IN SERVING SCIENCE, WILL DEMONSTRATE THE BENEFITS OF COLLABORATING TO ADVANCE THE SCIENCE OF TRANSPLANTATION AND CONNECTING BREAKTHROUGHS TO PATIENTS THIS WEEK AT THE 48TH ANNUAL MEETING OF THE AMERICAN SOCIETY FOR HISTOCOMPATIBILITY & IMMUNOGENETICS (ASHI) CONFERENCE IN LAS VEGAS.'}